# Compiled binaries and build output.
#
# The leading slashes are load-bearing. A pattern without one matches at every
# level, so a bare `weatherglass` also hid `cmd/weatherglass/` — which is the
# main package. It was invisible here, where the directory exists on disk, and
# fatal everywhere else: a fresh clone, and every CI run, failed to build with
# "stat /src/cmd/weatherglass: directory not found". Keep these anchored to the
# repository root.
/weatherglass
/dist/
/bin/

# Test and coverage output
*.test
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Local runtime data
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Local configuration and secrets
.env
*.local.yaml

# Editors and IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# Defensive: in case tooling is added later
node_modules/
